## Adding a new dependency

Don't add a dependency casually. Before adding one:

1. Check whether the stdlib or an existing dep already does it.
2. If a new dep is genuinely needed, add it to `pyproject.toml`'s `[project.dependencies]` (not a separate `requirements.txt`).
3. Mention the dep + why in the commit message.

